{"slug":"yue-cha-chaan-teng","title":"唔該，要一杯奶茶","audio":{"src":"audio.mp3?v=84d95b36"},"sents":[{"i":1,"en":"阿詩去茶餐廳食早餐。","zh":"阿诗去茶餐厅吃早餐。","t":[3.68,6.89],"rom":"aa3 si1 heoi3 caa4 caan1 teng1 sik6 zou2 caan1."},{"i":2,"en":"食咩呀？","zh":"吃什么？","t":[7.79,8.59],"rom":"sik6 me1 aa3?"},{"i":3,"en":"唔該，我要一個菠蘿包同一杯奶茶。","zh":"劳驾，我要一个菠萝包和一杯奶茶。","t":[9.34,14.07],"rom":"m4 goi1, ngo5 jiu3 jat1 go3 bo1 lo4 baau1 tung4 jat1 bui1 naai5 caa4."},{"i":4,"en":"熱定凍呀？","zh":"热的还是冰的？","t":[14.82,15.81],"rom":"jit6 ding6 dung3 aa3?"},{"i":5,"en":"凍嘅，唔該。","zh":"冰的，谢谢。","t":[16.56,18.21],"rom":"dung3 ge3, m4 goi1."},{"i":6,"en":"幾多錢呀？","zh":"多少钱？","t":[18.96,20.29],"rom":"gei2 do1 cin2 aa3?"},{"i":7,"en":"三十蚊。","zh":"三十块。","t":[21.04,22.0],"rom":"saam1 sap6 man1."}]}